OL,3,ASearch for Amelia Earhart's plane
OL,4,Aresumes after stormy weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe American pioneer vanished while
OL,7,Fattempting to circumnavigate the globe
OL,8,Fin 1937, spawning decades of
OL,9,Fspeculation about her fate.
OL,11,FRough seas and strong winds forced the
OL,12,Fteam to remain on their research vessel
OL,13,Ffor three days, until the weather
OL,14,Fcleared on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
